Spec: SpecDD IntelliJ Plugin

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Add IntelliJ support for SpecDD `.sdd` specification files.

Owns:
  Repository-level plugin structure and development contracts.

Structure:
  app.sdd: Repository-level SpecDD contract.
  Makefile: Convenience build targets for local and release workflows.
  src/main.sdd: Implementation-root SpecDD contract.
  src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea: SpecDD language package namespace.
  src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea: SpecDD language test package namespace.
  src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/highlighting: Syntax highlighting concern.
  src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/validation: Language validation concern.
  src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/structure: Structure view concern.
  src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/documentation: Hover documentation concern.
  src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/completion: Completion concern.
  src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/references: Path and glob reference concern.

Can modify:
  app.sdd
  Makefile
  README.md
  CHANGELOG.md
  build.gradle.kts
  gradle.properties
  settings.gradle.kts
  src/*
  fixtures/*

Must:
  Keep plugin behavior focused on SpecDD language support.
  Keep Makefile targets as thin wrappers around Gradle tasks.
  Place plugin code under the `ai.specdd.idea` package namespace.
  Use Kotest BehaviorSpec style for Kotlin tests.
  Keep syntax highlighting and language validation as separate implementation concerns.
  Provide syntax highlighting for `.sdd` files.
  Validate `.sdd` files against SpecDD structure and known section names.
  Provide IntelliJ Structure view entries for `.sdd` file sections.
  Provide inline documentation for known `.sdd` section labels.
  Provide completion for known section labels, file paths, and local symbols.
  Provide clickable navigation and unresolved-target warnings for file paths and globs.
  Report likely section-name typos and unsupported section names.

Must not:
  Add unrelated IDE features outside SpecDD language support.
  Add user-facing settings or configuration UI.
